1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,312
How does a new merchant earn the right to take card payments?

2
00:00:03,362 --> 00:00:11,400
To get a driving licence, you hand in your papers, each one is checked, you get a licence with its own number, and every step goes in your file.

3
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:14,208
A merchant earns its states the same way.

4
00:00:14,258 --> 00:00:20,712
First it uploads its company documents, because the bank must know who it does business with: know your business.

5
00:00:20,762 --> 00:00:28,200
The bank reads each file's real type from its contents, not its name, and keeps a fingerprint so a changed file is caught.

6
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:31,008
A bank admin checks every document.

7
00:00:31,058 --> 00:00:37,392
Only when all are verified can the company be verified, and then it signs a contract with its own unique number.

8
00:00:37,442 --> 00:00:43,224
Every move between states is written down: from where, to where, who, and why.

9
00:00:43,274 --> 00:00:47,184
So years later, anyone can see how a merchant became what it is.

10
00:00:47,234 --> 00:00:50,280
Next: why switching a merchant on needs two people.
